    "difficulty": "Mastery",
    "difficultyReason": "The parts supply the times d/s and the 1-hour-difference equation, so the modelling is signposted. The remaining demand is algebraic: combining or clearing two rational terms with denominators s and s+15, forming s²+15s-2700=0, factorising with a large constant, and rejecting the negative root. This is more than the routine single-quadratic framing in p19-q22. It is less than the unscaffolded modelling in p17-q18 and p19-q24.",
